PORT       | int           | required | 8080
HOST       | string        | required | localhost
DEBUG      | bool          |          | false
MODE       | enum:dev,prod |          | dev     
MESSAGE    | string        |          |
BANNER     | string        |          |
TESTVALUE1 | string        |          | test value1 default value
TESTVALUE2 | string        |          | test value2 default value
TESTVALUE3 | int           |          | 